[00:00.00] 作词 : Roger Waters
[00:00.40] 作曲 : Roger Waters
[00:01.40] 编曲 : Michael Kamen/Bob Ezrin
[00:02.40] 制作人 : Roger Waters/David Gilmour/Bob Ezrin/James K.A. Guthrie
[00:08.56]Momma loves her baby,
[00:08.56]妈妈爱她的宝贝
[00:13.74]And Daddy loves you, too
[00:13.74]爸爸也爱你
[00:18.68]And the sea may look warm to ya, Babe
[00:18.68]大海或许看上去很温暖，宝贝
[00:24.18]And the sky may look blue.
[00:24.18]天空或许看上去很湛蓝
[00:28.68]Oooooo Babe.
[00:28.68]呜，宝贝
[00:38.98]Ooooooo Baby Blue.
[00:38.98]呜，忧郁的宝贝
[00:50.29]Ooooo Ooohh Babe.
[00:50.29]呜，宝贝
[01:02.85]If you should go skating,
[01:02.85]若你要去溜个冰
[01:06.29]On the thin ice of modern life,
[01:06.29]在这现代生活的薄冰之上
[01:12.35]Dragging behind you the silent reproach,
[01:12.35]在你身后的是无声的责备
[01:17.10]Of a million tear-stained eyes,
[01:17.10]来自于一百万只含泪的眼睛
[01:23.35]Don't be surprised when a crack in the ice.
[01:23.35]当冰上出现了条裂缝，无须惊讶
[01:28.73]Appears under your feet.
[01:28.73]即使是出现在了你的脚下
[01:34.35]You slip out of your depth and out of your mind,
[01:34.35]你从思想深渊中滑出，你失去了你的头脑
[01:38.85]With your fear flowing out from behind you，
[01:38.85]你的恐惧在身后倾泻而出
[01:42.29]As you claw the thin ice.
[01:42.29]而你正紧紧抓住这最后一层薄冰
